sequenceDiagram
  actor Provider
  participant Mobile as Expo Mobile App
  participant Gateway as API Gateway
  participant BookingService as Booking Service
  participant BookingDb as booking
  participant NotificationService as Notification Service
  participant NotificationDb as notification_and_support

  Provider->>Mobile: Tap accept, start, complete, or reject
  Mobile->>Gateway: PATCH /v1/bookings/:bookingId/status
  Gateway->>Gateway: Validate provider token and role
  Gateway->>BookingService: PATCH /internal/bookings/:bookingId/status
  BookingService->>BookingDb: Read current booking status
  BookingDb-->>BookingService: Current status
  BookingService->>BookingService: Validate transition
  BookingService->>BookingDb: Update status and insert timeline event
  BookingDb-->>BookingService: Updated booking
  BookingService-->>Gateway: BookingSummary
  Gateway->>NotificationService: POST /internal/notifications
  NotificationService->>NotificationDb: Insert notification
  NotificationDb-->>NotificationService: Notification saved
  Gateway-->>Mobile: Updated booking
  Mobile-->>Provider: Refresh job details
